# Energy and history

Keep the native Energy dashboard as the owner of data, dates, units and costs. Civica changes only how the charts look. It never changes what they say.

## Examples

These examples are simulated. The values are invented and nothing here controls a home. Open an example to see it at full width or to view its HTML.

